cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite the article below (preferred citation) and this
  repository.
type: software
title: "Editorial interventions: LLM-assisted TEI encoding"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/DHGraz/editorial-interventions"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline that uses LLMs to turn bracket-marked editorial interventions in historical letters into
  TEI XML markup, and evaluates the output against a hand-made gold standard. Contains the code,
  the sample, the stored LLM output and the evaluation results of the article.
authors:
